The files in this directory are vendored, not written here.

They are the toast component from TPEOficial/dymo-saas
(src/components/internal/toast), itself derived from Sonner
(https://github.com/emilkowalski/sonner, MIT, Emil Kowalski), and they are kept
as close to verbatim as a library can keep them so the toast looks the same
everywhere it is used.

Three mechanical changes were unavoidable, and they are the only ones:

  - `@/utils/cn` became `./cn`, a two-line local file: a package cannot resolve a
    consumer's path alias.
  - `import "./styles.css"` was removed. The stylesheet lives in `styles.ts` as a
    string and `<Toaster />` injects it, because a package cannot assume its
    consumer has a CSS-capable bundler - and a toast at the edge of the screen is
    the one component a forgotten import ruins rather than merely undresses.
  - `JSX.Element` became `React.JSX.Element` in assets.tsx, which is where React
    19's types put it.

Refresh them from upstream rather than editing them here.
